  },
  {
   "setup" : [
    {
     "content" : "# LAB-9 — background checks in flight\n## Resume here\nStatus: active · State: retry fix committed on feat/x (checkpoint: clean)\nStep 1: `bin/test retry` — for \"fix the retry window\"\nGate: none · Don't: change the window size\nLive: nothing running (checked 2026-10-21 14:05 +0300)\n## User constraints\n- U-1: \"keep the 45 s window\" — scope retry window; user, 11111111\n## Decisions and do-not-re-raise\n- D-1: keep 45 s — because upstream retries at 40 s (user)\n## In flight\nNothing in flight — checked 2026-10-21 14:05 +0300 via task list\n## Live state\n| claim | as of | re-check | tag |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| HEAD on feat/x, clean | 2026-10-21 14:05 +0300 | `git -C $TMP/repo status -sb` | measured |\n## Open questions\nnone\n## Location\nrepo repo · worktree $TMP/repo · branch feat/x · this handoff: @self@\n## Work done and findings\n- retry fix: implemented — `app/retry.rb#retry_window`\n## Next steps\n1. `bin/test retry` — done when the suite passes\n",
     "write" : "$STAGE_PUB_P/body.md"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "argv" : [
    "publish",
    "--stage",
    "$STAGE_PUB_P",
    "--slug",
    "win-peer",
    "--status",
    "in-progress"
   ],
   "capture" : {
    "PUB_P" : "re:^Wrote handoff to: (.+)$"
   },
   "cwd" : "$TMP/repo",
   "expect" : {
    "exit" : 0,
    "stdout_has" : [
     "^Wrote handoff to: "
    ],
    "stdout_lacks" : [
     "^LINT "
    ]
   },
   "name" : "publish as win-peer",
   "now" : "2026-10-21T14:05:12+03:00"
  },
  {
   "setup" : [
    {
     "content" : "{\"session_id\": \"a9a9a9a9-1111-4222-8333-444444444444\", \"bucket\": \"repo/held\", \"bucket_path\": \"$ROOT/repo/held\"}",
     "write" : "$ROOT/.sessions/a9a9a9a9-1111-4222-8333-444444444444.json"
    },
    {
     "content" : "{\"session_id\": \"$SID\", \"bucket\": \"repo/LAB-7\", \"bucket_path\": \"$ROOT/repo/LAB-7\"}",
     "write" : "$ROOT/.sessions/$SID.json"
    },
